{"id":"P074-1","subject":"P","unit":"P074","unitTitle":"2025 ① (1월~4월) · 25.03.15 한국남동발전 (사람인)","set":1,"questions":[{"id":"P074-S1-Q01","number":1,"question":"25.03.15 한국남동발전 (사람인) · 객관식 1번","searchText":" 01\n, 일 때, × 의 방향은?\n      (단, , , 는 각각 , , 에 대한 방향벡터이다.)\n\n\n① 축 방향      ② 축 방향\n\n③ 축 방향     ④ 축 방향","source":{"collection":"2025p1","collectionLabel":"2025 ① (1월~4월)","examLabel":"25.03.15 한국남동발전 (사람인)","originalId":"2025p1-e07-m01","number":1},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e07-m01-q.webp","width":678,"height":502},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e07-m01-e1.webp","width":678,"height":965}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P074-S1-Q02","number":2,"question":"25.03.15 한국남동발전 (사람인) · 객관식 2번","searchText":" 02\n\n질량이 1kg인 작은 물체가 전하 C를 가지고 중력\n\n방향과 직각인 무한도체평면 아래쪽 1m거리에 놓여있\n\n다. 정전력이 중력과 같게 되기위한 C는?\n\n(단, 는 중력가속도이다.)\n\n\n\n\n\n①       ② \n③        ④ ","source":{"collection":"2025p1","collectionLabel":"2025 ① (1월~4월)","examLabel":"25.03.15 한국남동발전 (사람인)","originalId":"2025p1-e07-m02","number":2},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e07-m02-q.webp","width":678,"height":816},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e07-m02-e1.webp","width":678,"height":461},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e07-m02-e2.webp","width":696,"height":1883}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P074-S1-Q03","number":3,"question":"25.03.15 한국남동발전 (사람인) · 객관식 3번","searchText":" 03\n\n두 개의 점자하 × , × \n간에 척력이 N 으로 작용한다. 두 점자하 사이의 거리               \nm는? (단, × Hm이다.\n\n\n① 2          ② 4\n\n③ 8          ④ 16","source":{"collection":"2025p1","collectionLabel":"2025 ① (1월~4월)","examLabel":"25.03.15 한국남동발전 (사람인)","originalId":"2025p1-e07-m03","number":3},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e07-m03-q.webp","width":678,"height":518},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e07-m03-e1.webp","width":678,"height":546}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P074-S1-Q04","number":4,"question":"25.03.15 한국남동발전 (사람인) · 객관식 4번","searchText":" 04\n\n맥스웰 전자방정식으로 옳게 구성된 것은?\n\n①         ,           ,  ,       \n②         ,           ,  ,       \n③         ,           ,  ,       \n④         ,           ,  ,       ","source":{"collection":"2025p1","collectionLabel":"2025 ① (1월~4월)","examLabel":"25.03.15 한국남동발전 (사람인)","originalId":"2025p1-e07-m04","number":4},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e07-m04-q.webp","width":696,"height":670},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e07-m04-e1.webp","width":678,"height":949}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P074-S1-Q05","number":5,"question":"25.03.15 한국남동발전 (사람인) · 객관식 5번","searchText":" 05\n\n효율이 39인 화력발전소에서 발열량이 1kg당 500